    "This file is NOT loaded by the app. It exists so the shipped dataset can be diffed against an",
    "independent source: `npm run data:crosscheck` reports every badge where the two disagree, and a",
    "test fails if a disagreement is not recorded in `knownConflicts` below.",
    "",
    "The point is that agreement between two independently-produced sources is much stronger evidence",
    "than either alone — and that when they DISAGREE, the app says so instead of silently picking one.",
    "",
    "This source does not publish badge TOKEN COSTS, so it corroborates requirements and height gates",
    "only.",
    "",
    "TIER FORMAT:  '70 driving_layup'                     single requirement",
    "              '60 driving_layup + 60 strength'       both required (AND)",
    "              '65 close_shot | 65 driving_layup'     either satisfies (OR)",
    "HEIGHT:       inches, or null for no restriction (the chart's '-')."
  ],

